                                "sense_id": "add19ef5-e9e1-3c99-8029-fb0c939c0c69",
                                "text": "The cloud had sunk, and filled with fold on fold\nThe chimneyed city; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2aadca32-01b5-4299-8cea-e0d7510149d6",
                                "sense_id": "add19ef5-e9e1-3c99-8029-fb0c939c0c69",
                                "text": "He had watched the evening close in lurid and stormy across the chimneyed wastes of the black country, until the darkness covered all the land, and wiped out even the last memory of the dead day from the western sky."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89642bd0-f1a1-4836-896b-e78adf052b85",
                                "sense_id": "add19ef5-e9e1-3c99-8029-fb0c939c0c69",
                                "text": "[T]hey stood before a farmhouse, timbered and chimneyed […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9da213a8-8133-44f9-acec-03f6ab944678",
                                "sense_id": "add19ef5-e9e1-3c99-8029-fb0c939c0c69",
                                "text": "They found a rough-cast country cottage, old, damp, decayed; smoky chimneyed and rat-riddled; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed631b6b-bd14-4b41-b2fe-ef088bebe276",
                                "sense_id": "add19ef5-e9e1-3c99-8029-fb0c939c0c69",
                                "text": "Through this window, and still better from the parapet outside, may be seen […] the hint beyond a steepled and chimneyed horizon of the wooded heights of Highgate."
                            }
